  /* v6.2 attempt 2 (lore l.49-64 order, verify v6.1 r2 accuracy): in the boot handoff the Shadow Realm's smoke rose from page 0.5 s, while the
     Items still sat in the Stone's row (they leave it ~1.45-1.7 s). It now rises with the walls' breaks, after the Items have left: one layer,
     eased in over 1.75-2.6 s (the breaks grow 2.0-2.95 s, Nut's fracture 2.0-2.95 s, the breach opens 2.2-2.9 s). */
  if (ENTER) { const k = e * eOut(seg(t, 1.75, 2.6)); if (k <= .01) return; if (k >= .999) return sm0.call(this, g, t, e); return asLayer(g, k, 'fxSmoke', q => sm0.call(this, q, t, 1)); }
